.TH QUIPU-TRUST-ROOT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-trust\-root \- Enroll the first human key of the root of trust
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu trust\-root\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enroll the first human key of the root of trust
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-trust\-root\-challenge(1)
Issue the proof\-of\-possession challenge for a first verifier key
.TP
quipu\-trust\-root\-bootstrap(1)
Enroll the first verifier key with its signed challenge
.TP
quipu\-trust\-root\-status(1)
Show the root\-of\-trust state
.TP
quipu\-trust\-root\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
